## MCP Integration for Windsurf

Add SRIFT to `~/.codeium/windsurf/mcp_config.json`:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "srift": {
      "command": "srift",
      "args": ["mcp"]
    }
  }
}
```

Or via hosted MCP:
```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "srift": {
      "url": "https://srift.app/mcp"
    }
  }
}
```

